:::oak-heading {id="title" level="1"}
Composing in a samba style
:::

:::oak-heading {id="task-a" level="2"}
Task A: Composing a 12/8 groove
:::

:::oak-instruction {id="task-a-instruction"}
Create a 12/8 main groove. Use at least one low and two high parts, a four-beat pattern, a simple rhythm on the surdo, a syncopated pattern and a variety of strikes.
:::

